@startuml
[*] --> Shut Down : Initial State
Shut Down --> Running : System Restarted
Running --> Configuration Mode : Power-Saving Settings Required or Configuration Changes Required
Configuration Mode --> Running : Configuration Completed
Running --> Data Collection : Clock Trigger
Data Collection --> Running : Activity Completed
Running --> Weather Summary Preparation : Request Received
Weather Summary Preparation --> Running : Activity Completed
Running --> Status Checking : Request Received
Status Checking --> Running : Activity Completed
Running --> Controlled Mode : Remote Control Command
Controlled Mode --> Shut Down : System Powered Off
Shut Down --> [*] : Final State
@enduml
